#: src/onboarding.py:665
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Ṣeto itanna 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:666
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Ṣeto itanna 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ko le fipamọ awoṣe oju"

#: src/onboarding.py:712 src/onboarding.py:759
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Ṣayẹwo awoṣe keji"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Ko le ṣe igbasilẹ awoṣe keji"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Awoṣe akọkọ rẹ ti wa ni fipamọ, nitorina iwọle oju ti ṣiṣẹ tẹlẹ. Yara naa "
"gbọdọ tun ni imọlẹ to lati rii oju rẹ - yi ina pada dipo ki o pa a - lẹhinna "
"gbiyanju lẹẹkansi, tabi fo ki o ṣafikun awoṣe nigbamii lati Eto."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Àyẹ̀wò kejì: gíláàsì, irun ojú tàbí ìmọ́lẹ̀ tó yàtọ̀"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"A ti fi àwòṣe àkọ́kọ́ pamọ́: ìwọlé pẹ̀lú ojú ti ń ṣiṣẹ́. Àwòṣe kejì máa ń mú kí "
"ìdámọ̀ ní ìgbẹ́kẹ̀lé sí i nígbà tí nǹkan bá yí padà: wọ gíláàsì tí o máa ń wọ "
"nígbà mìíràn (tàbí bọ́ ọ), gbà á sílẹ̀ pẹ̀lú irun ojú tó yàtọ̀, kí o sì yí ìmọ́lẹ̀ "
"padà — tan tàbí pa àtùpà, kúrò ní ẹ̀bá fèrèsé. Jẹ́ kí ojú rẹ hàn kedere kí o "
"sì tún tẹ Ṣàyẹ̀wò; ìgbàsílẹ̀ kúkúrú tí a tọ́ka kan náà yóò tẹ̀lé e."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello le ṣii laifọwọyi {} rẹ nipa lilo ijẹrisi oju (apamọwọ ti a rii: "
"{}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ipo TPM:</b> Ṣiṣayẹwo ohun elo TPM ati awọn irinṣẹ..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello le ṣii laifọwọyi {} rẹ nipa lilo ijẹrisi oju (apamọwọ ti a rii: "
"{}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ipo TPM:</b> Awari ohun elo TPM. Fifi <i>tpm2-tools</i> sori ẹrọ "
"laifọwọyi..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello le ṣii laifọwọyi {} rẹ nipa lilo ijẹrisi oju (apamọwọ ti a rii: "
"{}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ipo TPM:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 nṣiṣẹ. Ọrọigbaniwọle rẹ yoo wa ni ifipamo "
"ni aabo inu TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello lè ṣí {} rẹ láìfọwọ́yí nípa lílo ìjẹ́rìísí ojú (àpamọ́wọ́ tí a rí: "
"{}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ipò TPM:</b> A rí ohun èlò TPM, ṣùgbọ́n fífi <i>tpm2-tools</i> sórí ẹ̀rọ "
"láìfọwọ́yí kùnà. Ṣiṣẹ́ <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. A padà sí "
"ìpamọ́ ìwé-ẹ̀rí orí sọ́fítíwéà."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello le ṣii laifọwọyi {} rẹ nipa lilo ijẹrisi oju (apamọwọ ti a rii: "
"{}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Ipo TPM:</b> Ko si ohun elo TPM ti a rii. Lilo caching ijẹrisi orisun "
"software (AES-256-GCM)."

