#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Awọn aworan oju rẹ ti Ubuntu Hello ṣe afiwe si. Jeki o kere ju meji, gbasilẹ "
"ni oriṣiriṣi ina."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Nfihan awọn awoṣe ti o fipamọ fun:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Àwòṣe ojú kan ṣoṣo ni a ti forúkọ sílẹ̀. Gíláàsì, ìyípadà irun ojú tàbí ìmọ́lẹ̀ "
"tó yàtọ̀ máa ń yí bí kámẹ́rà ṣe rí ojú rẹ padà, nítorí náà àwòṣe kan ṣoṣo lè "
"kùnà (fún àpẹẹrẹ ní ìrọ̀lẹ́ lábẹ́ àtùpà). Fi àwòṣe kejì kún un pẹ̀lú gíláàsì "
"tàbí láìsí i, ìrísí rẹ mìíràn, tàbí ní ìmọ́lẹ̀ tó yàtọ̀ kí ṣíṣí sílẹ̀ lè máa ní "
"ìgbẹ́kẹ̀lé."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Fi awoṣe keji kun"

