#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Iwifunni tabili kan fihan lakoko ti Ubuntu Hello n wa oju rẹ, lẹhinna ṣe "
"ijabọ abajade. Awọn igbiyanju ti o kuna duro ninu atokọ iwifunni."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Ṣe afihan awọn iwifunni"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Kaadi kan fun igbiyanju idaniloju-oju, imudojuiwọn ni aye pẹlu abajade."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Awọn ohun iwifunni"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Mu awọn eto ohun fun a mọ tabi kuna igbiyanju."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Fi awọn iwadii aisan sii"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ṣafikun awoṣe, idaniloju la ẹnu-ọna, awọn fireemu, kamẹra ati aago si kaadi "
"kọọkan. Wulo nigba ijabọ iṣoro kan."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Ààbò"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Bí ojú rẹ ṣe gbọ́dọ̀ bá a mu tó, àti bóyá Ubuntu Hello yóò ní kí o jẹ́rìí pé o "
"wà níbẹ̀ ní tòótọ́."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Bí ìbáradọ́gba ojú ṣe le tó"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Yara"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Iwontunwonsi"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Ni aabo"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Béèrè pé kí n mi orí láti jẹ́rìí sí i"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Lẹ́yìn tí ojú rẹ bá bá a mu, ìwífúnni kan yóò ní kí o mi orí rẹ. Fọ́tò tí a "
"gbé sí iwájú kámẹ́rà kò lè mi orí."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Ṣii silẹ laifọwọyi"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Mu ijẹrisi oju ṣiṣẹ lati ṣii bọtini iwọle rẹ laifọwọyi tabi KWallet ni "
"wiwole. Eyi tọju ọrọ igbaniwọle rẹ ni aabo ni aabo ni TPM nigba ti o wa, "
"tabi ti paroko pẹlu AES-256-GCM nipa lilo bọtini titunto-root nikan. Awọn "
"iṣeto auth oju PAM_AUTHTOK fun pam_gnome_keyring tabi pam_kwallet5 da lori "
"tabili tabili rẹ."

#: src/main.ui:814
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Ipo lọwọlọwọ:"

#: src/main.ui:823
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Ṣiṣayẹwo..."

#: src/main.ui:834
msgid "Enable Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Mu Ṣii silẹ Aifọwọyi ṣiṣẹ"

#: src/main.ui:862
msgid "Keyring"
msgstr "Oruka mimu Kọkọrọ dani"

#: src/main.ui:898
msgid "Display language"
msgstr "Èdè ìfihàn"

#: src/main.ui:913
msgid "Automatic follows the system language. Changes apply immediately."
msgstr "Aìfọwọ́yí tẹ̀lé èdè ètò ẹ̀rọ. Àwọn àyípadà máa ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀."

#: src/main.ui:936 src/main.ui:956
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Ede"

#: src/main.ui:977
msgid "Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/main.ui:990
msgid "Facial authentication for Linux"
msgstr "Ijeri oju fun Linux"

#: src/main.ui:999
msgid "Version unknown"
msgstr "Ẹya aimọ"

#: src/main.ui:1013
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Open GitHub link</a> "
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Ṣi ọna asopọ GitHub</a>"

#: src/main.ui:1020
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">Report a problem "
"or suggest a feature</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">jabọ iṣoro kan "
"tabi daba ẹya kan</a>"

#: src/main.ui:1032
msgid "About"
msgstr "Nipa"

#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Kaabo si Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:52
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Iṣeto ti ṣe!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:68
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"A ti pari! Ubuntu Hello ti n ṣiṣẹ lọwọlọwọ lori kọnputa yii. Gbiyanju lati "
"ṣe ohunkohun ti o yoo ni deede lati tẹ ọrọ igbaniwọle rẹ fun lati jẹri, bii "
"ṣiṣe aṣẹ pẹlu sudo. Ti o ba mu ṣiṣi silẹ aifọwọyi ṣiṣẹ, bọtini iwọle tabi "
"KWallet yoo tun ṣii laifọwọyi ni wiwole.\n"
"\n"
"O le ṣii Ubuntu Hello Oluṣeto nigbamii lati yi awọn eto ilọsiwaju diẹ sii "
"tabi ṣafikun awọn awoṣe afikun. Tẹ Pari ni isalẹ lati tii ferese yii ki o "
"ṣii Ubuntu Hello Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.ui:105
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Ṣiṣeto eto imulo idaniloju"

#: src/onboarding.ui:121
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Nitori awọn iyipada ninu awọn igun, ijinna, ati awọn ifosiwewe miiran ibaamu "
"oju kii ṣe deede kanna bii awoṣe oju ti o fipamọ. Lori oju-iwe yii o le ṣeto "
"bi o ṣe yẹ Ubuntu Hello to muna."

#: src/onboarding.ui:160
msgid ""
"The most forgiving match and the quickest to let you in. Choose this if "
"convenience matters more than strictness."
msgstr ""
"Ìbáradọ́gba tí ó rọ̀ jù lọ tí ó sì yára jù lọ láti jẹ́ kí o wọlé. Yan èyí bí "
"ìrọ̀rùn bá ṣe pàtàkì ju líle lọ."

#: src/onboarding.ui:191
msgid ""
"A strict match that still logs you in quickly. It may not recognise you at a "
"sharp angle or from further away."
msgstr ""
"Ìbáradọ́gba tí ó le, ṣùgbọ́n tí ó ṣì ń jẹ́ kí o wọlé kíákíá. Ó lè má mọ̀ ọ́ nígbà "
"tí o bá wà ní igun gbọ̀n-ọ́n tàbí ní ọ̀nà jíjìn."

#: src/onboarding.ui:223
msgid "The strictest match, with no extra step when you log in. Recommended."
msgstr ""
"Ìbáradọ́gba tí ó le jù lọ, láìsí ìgbésẹ̀ àfikún nígbà tí o bá wọlé. A gbà á "
"nímọ̀ràn."

#: src/onboarding.ui:379
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Rekọja fun bayi"

#: src/onboarding.ui:384
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"O le ṣafikun awọn awoṣe oju diẹ sii nigbamii lati Eto tabi pẹlu: sudo ubuntu-"
"hello add"

#: src/onboarding.ui:403 src/onboarding.ui:531
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Ṣiṣeto kamera wẹẹbu"

#: src/onboarding.ui:435
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Njẹ emitter infurarẹẹdi ti nmọlẹ bi?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:447
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Wo kamẹra ti o yan: Kamẹra infurarẹẹdi kan fihan ina kekere kan ti o ṣaju "
"lakoko ti Ubuntu Hello n ṣe idanwo rẹ. Eyi sọ fun wa boya o le rii oju rẹ "
"ninu okunkun."

#: src/onboarding.ui:481
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Bẹẹni, o tan imọlẹ"

#: src/onboarding.ui:507
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Rara, ko si ohun ti o tan imọlẹ"

#: src/onboarding.ui:547
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello yoo wa ẹrọ rẹ laifọwọyi fun eyikeyi awọn kamẹra ti o wa, "
"nitorinaa rii daju pe kamera wẹẹbu rẹ ti sopọ. Lẹhin wiwa atokọ ti awọn "
"kamera wẹẹbu nkan elo yoo han. Yan eyi ti o fẹ lati lo ki o tẹ Itele."

#: src/onboarding.ui:566
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Ṣe idanwo awọn kamera wẹẹbu rẹ, jọwọ duro..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:613
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Gbigba awọn faili data"

#: src/onboarding.ui:629
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello nilo awọn ipilẹ data idanimọ oju ti ikẹkọ mẹta ṣaaju lati ni "
"anfani lati da ọ mọ, eyiti yoo ṣe igbasilẹ ni bayi. O le wo ilọsiwaju "
"igbasilẹ ni isalẹ."

#: src/onboarding.ui:653
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Bibẹrẹ igbasilẹ..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:697
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Kaabo si Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:709
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Ẹya"

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Oluṣeto yii yoo rin ọ nipasẹ ilana iṣeto ati tunto Ubuntu Hello laifọwọyi "
"fun ọ. Tẹ atẹle lati tẹsiwaju."

#: src/onboarding.ui:775
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello le ṣii laifọwọyi bọtini iwọle rẹ tabi KWallet ni lilo ìfàṣẹsí "
"oju, idilọwọ awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle leyin ti o wọle."

#: src/onboarding.ui:787
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Mu bọtini bọtini ṣiṣẹ laifọwọyi/Ṣiṣii KWallet"

#: src/onboarding.ui:815
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "So ni pato orukoabawole re"

#: src/onboarding.ui:872
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Pada"

#: src/onboarding.ui:907
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Pari iṣeto"

#: src/onboarding.ui:934
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Itele"

